WEBVTT

00:07:58.358 --> 00:08:02.278
If you think you know
your birth day, raise your hand.

00:08:02.302 --> 00:08:05.492
Let's see, starting with --
let's start with a gentleman first.

00:08:05.516 --> 00:08:07.167
What year was it, first of all?

00:08:07.191 --> 00:08:08.976
That's why I pick a gentleman first.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.063
Audience: 1953.

00:08:10.087 --> 00:08:11.976
1953, and the month?

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.230
November what?

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.910
23rd -- was that a Monday?

00:08:15.934 --> 00:08:16.935
Audience: Yes.

00:08:16.959 --> 00:08:18.340
Good. Somebody else?

00:08:18.364 --> 00:08:20.181
I haven't seen any women's hands up.

00:08:20.205 --> 00:08:21.976
OK, how about you, what year?

00:08:22.744 --> 00:08:23.976
1949, and the month?

00:08:24.586 --> 00:08:25.976
October what?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.706
Fifth -- was that a Wednesday?

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.254
Yes! I'll go way to the back
right now, how about you?